WEBVTT

01:40.000 --> 01:41.640
I knew you were having an affair!

01:41.720 --> 01:43.080
I will destroy you…

01:48.360 --> 01:49.200
Where's Fang Jin?

01:51.560 --> 01:53.080
It's okay. Let's search.

01:53.160 --> 01:54.840
She must've hidden somewhere.

01:54.920 --> 01:55.920
Fang Jin!

01:57.680 --> 01:58.760
Fang Jin, come out!

02:00.160 --> 02:01.760
Stop hiding! It's no use! Come out!

02:02.880 --> 02:05.640
- Fang Jin? Is she there?
- No.

02:06.400 --> 02:07.600
It's okay. Let's film him first.

02:08.479 --> 02:11.280
Film his face. Make sure it's clear.
Don't block it. Come on.

02:11.360 --> 02:12.680
Then move to the table.

02:12.760 --> 02:15.120
- Record everything from every angle.
- Okay.

02:15.200 --> 02:16.440
Come on. Look at this.

02:16.520 --> 02:17.520
So many things.

02:17.600 --> 02:22.120
They were ashamed of this affair
and came to the lab for a date.

02:23.200 --> 02:24.240
What's this?

02:25.280 --> 02:27.320
No candle. You made a lamp, didn't you?

02:28.600 --> 02:29.880
So romantic.

02:30.640 --> 02:32.560
Who'd believe this is not a date?

02:32.640 --> 02:33.520
Do you know what this is?

02:33.600 --> 02:34.960
Caught you in the act!

02:35.040 --> 02:38.040
I'm wondering how you're going
to explain this affair to the judge.

02:38.120 --> 02:39.480
Fang Jin is innocent.

02:40.560 --> 02:41.760
Don't talk nonsense.

02:41.840 --> 02:43.800
I'm talking nonsense?

02:43.880 --> 02:45.560
I'm just telling the truth! Understand?

02:46.880 --> 02:48.120
Who's having an affair?

02:48.200 --> 02:49.880
We like to eat in the lab.

02:49.960 --> 02:51.200
Is it illegal?

02:53.120 --> 02:54.040
Wait.

02:54.840 --> 02:56.720
Well, why are you here? Where's Fang Jin?

02:56.800 --> 02:59.160
Why can't I be here?

03:01.360 --> 03:03.000
We're both single.

03:03.080 --> 03:04.440
Why can't we eat together?

03:04.520 --> 03:07.160
Even if we're dating,

03:07.240 --> 03:08.120
it's none of your business.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.400
Are you dating?

03:16.280 --> 03:17.120
Yes.

03:18.720 --> 03:22.160
Guan Shengyu,
get out of Fang Jin's lab now.

03:22.920 --> 03:24.040
I'm warning you.

03:24.560 --> 03:26.480
If you dare to slander Fang Jin again,

03:26.560 --> 03:29.000
I… I won't go easy on you!

03:30.720 --> 03:31.880
Is Tang Qi interested in you?

03:32.560 --> 03:34.160
You should look at yourself in the mirror.

03:34.240 --> 03:35.280
Right?

03:52.800 --> 03:56.080
Su Chengcheng
is righteous and hard-working.

03:57.400 --> 03:58.680
I think she's pretty.

04:00.680 --> 04:01.600
However,

04:03.560 --> 04:05.400
you look decent,

04:05.480 --> 04:08.400
but you're nasty and ugly inside.

04:08.480 --> 04:09.440
Enough.

04:09.520 --> 04:11.200
Stop fooling me.

04:11.280 --> 04:12.680
Even if you're dating,

04:12.760 --> 04:14.720
why would you come to Fang Jin's lab?

04:15.320 --> 04:17.399
Your lies have no logic at all, okay?

04:19.640 --> 04:21.480
This is cosplay, okay?

04:23.200 --> 04:24.040
What?

04:25.240 --> 04:28.560
We're playing the shy doctor

04:29.560 --> 04:31.600
and the rude assistant.

04:33.040 --> 04:34.920
Dr. Tang, is that right?

04:53.680 --> 04:54.960
Stop filming this. Put it down.

04:55.040 --> 04:57.240
Guan Shengyu, you're old.

04:57.320 --> 04:59.520
I understand you don't know
what young people like.

04:59.600 --> 05:02.880
However, you can't just slander someone
for having an affair.

05:02.960 --> 05:05.960
Fine, then please tell Fang Jin

05:06.040 --> 05:07.400
to not try to fight against me,

05:07.480 --> 05:09.160
or I won't go easy on her.

05:26.080 --> 05:28.040
What is going on? Why are you here?

05:29.640 --> 05:32.360
I… I came here to see Fang Jin

05:32.440 --> 05:35.760
and met a friend in the elevator,
so we had a small chat at her place.

05:37.000 --> 05:38.240
Then there was a power outage,

05:38.320 --> 05:40.040
and I was worried about Fang Jin,

05:40.120 --> 05:41.360
so I came over to check on her.

05:41.440 --> 05:43.640
I happened to see Guan Shengyu
making a scene,

05:43.720 --> 05:45.280
so I came here to help you out.

05:46.600 --> 05:47.720
Where's Fang Jin?

05:48.720 --> 05:52.240
Well… She must've sneaked out.

05:52.320 --> 05:53.800
Otherwise, Guan Shengyu
would've caught her.

05:54.400 --> 05:55.720
When did she leave? Why didn't I see her?

05:56.360 --> 05:59.120
If you saw her, Guan Shengyu
would've seen her too.

05:59.200 --> 06:01.600
She must've sneaked out
while you two were arguing.

06:17.120 --> 06:18.840
Well…

06:20.640 --> 06:21.800
Don't tell…

06:24.320 --> 06:25.200
anyone about this.

06:26.960 --> 06:28.120
About what?

06:29.800 --> 06:31.600
Guan Shengyu's harassment?

06:34.080 --> 06:35.480
The shy doctor.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.640
Okay, I won't tell anyone.

06:51.880 --> 06:52.720
Just don't.

07:17.840 --> 07:21.320
Su Chengcheng
is righteous and hard-working.

07:22.600 --> 07:23.880
I think she's pretty.

08:01.960 --> 08:03.280
DEAR CHENG

08:03.360 --> 08:05.960
Someone praised me today.

08:06.760 --> 08:08.840
Did you help someone?

08:10.120 --> 08:12.840
Since childhood, my sister
has been considered as beautiful,

08:12.920 --> 08:14.240
while I'm hard-working and talkative.

08:14.320 --> 08:16.200
When the boys came,
my dad was worried that my sister

08:16.280 --> 08:19.920
would date early, yet he only told me
not to fight with them.

08:21.560 --> 08:23.320
Your dad had a point.

08:23.400 --> 08:25.080
You couldn't afford the medical bills.

08:26.880 --> 08:28.400
You're my real sister.

08:30.960 --> 08:31.800
Real sister indeed.

08:44.840 --> 08:46.280
It's Chengcheng and Mr. Tang.

08:47.160 --> 08:48.000
Show me.

08:48.080 --> 08:49.520
Send me another one.

08:49.600 --> 08:50.800
- Send me.
- Send me.

08:57.520 --> 09:01.320
Su Chengcheng, when did you
start dating Mr. Tang?

09:01.400 --> 09:02.880
We didn't notice it at all!

09:03.480 --> 09:04.800
How did it start?

09:04.880 --> 09:10.000
You should ask when Mr. Tang
was blackmailed.

09:14.400 --> 09:18.240
Do you mean I blackmailed Mr. Tang?

09:19.040 --> 09:20.400
I didn't say that.

09:24.880 --> 09:29.760
THOUSAND BIRDS COLLECTION

09:38.440 --> 09:41.320
These photos are not blackmailing.

09:41.880 --> 09:43.880
They were taken

09:43.960 --> 09:46.840
when Mr. Tang treated me
to dinner last night.

09:47.680 --> 09:50.560
Mr. Tang was kind and proactive.

09:53.520 --> 09:54.560
Su Chengcheng.

10:00.040 --> 10:00.880
Follow me.

10:09.400 --> 10:11.360
She went too far.

10:11.440 --> 10:13.040
Look at her.

10:13.120 --> 10:15.680
How could Mr. Tang be proactive?

10:16.600 --> 10:18.760
It's normal to lie for one's dignity.

10:18.840 --> 10:20.040
But the point is,

10:20.680 --> 10:22.440
does she have dignity?

10:25.760 --> 10:27.040
Su Chengcheng didn't lie.

10:27.960 --> 10:29.640
I treated her to dinner last night.

10:31.240 --> 10:33.520
And I was proactive when taking photos.

10:33.600 --> 10:36.080
Are you really in a relationship?

10:36.880 --> 10:37.760
No.

10:45.760 --> 10:46.960
I'm pursuing Su Chengcheng.

10:51.080 --> 10:52.240
But she hasn't said yes.

10:58.200 --> 11:00.200
A noble person respects
others' virtues and strengths.

11:00.280 --> 11:02.040
It's 2024,

11:02.120 --> 11:03.760
but you only care about appearance.

11:04.400 --> 11:06.480
- You're so narrow-minded.
- Yes.

11:17.120 --> 11:19.280
I'm really impressed.

11:20.200 --> 11:22.040
I'm not tolerant,
and you're not righteous.

11:22.120 --> 11:23.920
Let's give each other a break.

11:34.040 --> 11:35.800
Thank you for what happened.

11:37.440 --> 11:39.240
But I didn't lie.

11:39.320 --> 11:41.400
I was telling the truth.

11:44.040 --> 11:45.560
Sorry about that.

11:45.640 --> 11:47.360
I shouldn't have omitted part of the story

11:47.440 --> 11:49.680
and been vague about it to mislead them.

11:49.760 --> 11:51.120
I will try to fix it.

11:51.880 --> 11:54.080
Don't worry, I will explain it to them.

11:54.160 --> 11:55.280
It won't affect you.

11:55.360 --> 11:56.720
HUAYUN, RECEIVER: SU CHENGCHENG

11:57.320 --> 11:58.400
Pay the bill.

12:03.680 --> 12:07.280
"Receiver, Su Chengcheng.

12:08.680 --> 12:10.520
Romantic love.

12:11.120 --> 12:13.040
One bouquet every week,

12:13.120 --> 12:15.480
six weeks in total."

12:16.520 --> 12:17.360
Wait.

12:18.000 --> 12:20.320
Why should I send myself flowers?

12:21.400 --> 12:22.280
It's from me.

12:23.760 --> 12:25.800
I'll send you a bouquet every week

12:26.400 --> 12:28.080
until Fang Jin's divorce case is over.

12:28.720 --> 12:29.720
Why?

12:29.800 --> 12:31.760
Guan Shengyu exposed the photos,

12:32.440 --> 12:34.040
not to just take it out on us.

12:36.440 --> 12:37.320
I got it.

12:38.040 --> 12:40.200
So, you think Guan Shengyu
still don't believe it

12:40.280 --> 12:41.880
and wants to test us, right?

12:43.200 --> 12:45.000
No wonder you helped me just now

12:45.080 --> 12:46.760
and said you were pursuing me.

12:46.840 --> 12:49.360
I was so freaked out
that I didn't know how to thank you.

12:50.840 --> 12:53.000
It turns out you're doing this
for Fang Jin.

12:55.200 --> 12:57.160
No. I… I'm also…

12:57.240 --> 12:58.480
I know.

12:58.560 --> 13:01.280
For the patent of Air Fiber Elastic Mesh.

13:01.360 --> 13:03.200
Guan Shengyu is so nasty.

13:03.280 --> 13:05.720
He cheated first,
but he's slandering the victim.

13:07.560 --> 13:09.000
Pay the bill.

13:13.320 --> 13:15.400
ONE ITEM, 1,263 YUAN IN TOTAL

13:15.480 --> 13:17.600
What flowers?

13:18.200 --> 13:19.600
Why are they so expensive?

13:21.120 --> 13:22.200
Su Qingli will pay you back.

13:23.600 --> 13:25.840
Fine. This is business.

13:28.600 --> 13:31.920
Although it's a show, from now on,

13:32.000 --> 13:34.800
I'll also have an admirer.

13:34.880 --> 13:35.880
Thank you.

14:02.960 --> 14:05.000
Su Chengcheng. Your flowers.

14:05.080 --> 14:07.040
- Thanks.
- You're welcome.

14:09.440 --> 14:10.520
They're so beautiful.

14:11.760 --> 14:14.960
I heard some single ladies
would be so pretentious

14:15.040 --> 14:16.680
that they'd buy flowers for themselves.

14:19.360 --> 14:20.800
There's a card from the sender.

14:23.560 --> 14:24.760
TANG QI

14:24.840 --> 14:26.520
It's from Mr. Tang.

14:30.280 --> 14:31.800
Mr. Tang is so romantic.

14:52.400 --> 14:55.640
Do I need to pay for this card?

14:55.720 --> 14:57.520
SU CHENGCHENG

14:57.600 --> 14:58.600
No.

14:58.680 --> 15:00.880
The note was randomly
generated by the shop.

15:29.560 --> 15:30.400
Indeed.

15:31.200 --> 15:33.520
Lies are like desserts.

15:33.600 --> 15:35.800
They're not healthy,

15:35.880 --> 15:39.120
but they're sweet and can make you happy.

16:04.280 --> 16:05.800
In the long process of evolution,

16:05.880 --> 16:09.080
humans need to absorb
enough energy to survive.

16:09.160 --> 16:11.440
Sweetness is often related
to high-calorie food,

16:12.000 --> 16:15.720
so the preference for sweet food

16:15.800 --> 16:18.760
is a survival mechanism in our genes.

16:20.560 --> 16:24.240
Your desire for sweets
is a false instinctual impulse.

16:25.160 --> 16:29.160
However, the evolution of genes
didn't catch up with the times.

16:36.080 --> 16:37.320
What a pity.

16:37.400 --> 16:39.280
It turns out that in ancient times,

16:39.360 --> 16:41.800
you were healthy food
necessary for survival,

16:41.880 --> 16:44.600
but now you've been abandoned by the times

16:44.680 --> 16:46.520
and become a health hazard.

16:56.600 --> 16:58.800
The joy of eating sweets is real.

16:58.880 --> 16:59.880
It's not a lie.

17:23.800 --> 17:26.040
Guan Shengyu exposed
the photos without permission

17:26.119 --> 17:27.359
and invaded your privacy.

17:27.440 --> 17:29.400
You can ask him to pay
for your moral damages.

17:30.040 --> 17:31.480
We can't just wait.

17:32.040 --> 17:34.360
We must find the evidence
of his infidelity

17:34.440 --> 17:36.240
and help Fang Jin win the case.

17:41.440 --> 17:44.520
JOY KIDS

17:47.600 --> 17:50.040
Hello, miss. Our hotel is having
an anniversary event.

17:50.120 --> 17:51.760
You can get lucky draws
by shopping at the mall.

17:51.840 --> 17:52.840
You might win a special prize.

17:52.920 --> 17:55.160
It includes a deluxe suite, French dinner,

17:55.240 --> 17:56.400
and free champagne and wine.

18:01.360 --> 18:03.360
You've won our…

18:04.040 --> 18:05.560
SPECIAL PRIZE

18:05.640 --> 18:06.840
Special prize!

18:08.120 --> 18:10.040
Miss, you're so lucky!

18:10.120 --> 18:13.080
Are there any additional fees?

18:13.840 --> 18:15.520
No additional fees.

18:15.600 --> 18:16.520
With this voucher,

18:16.600 --> 18:18.040
you can get a room card
at the hotel reception

18:18.120 --> 18:20.680
and enjoy the deluxe suite, French dinner,

18:20.760 --> 18:22.040
and free champagne and wine.

18:22.120 --> 18:24.840
If you have any doubts,
you can call our hotel in advance.

18:24.920 --> 18:25.760
Thanks.

18:25.840 --> 18:28.040
Guan Shengyu has been
a little indifferent to me.

18:28.120 --> 18:32.560
I'll tell him I booked a hotel
and want to have fun to please him.

18:33.320 --> 18:34.400
Have a nice day.

18:34.480 --> 18:35.440
Bye.

18:36.760 --> 18:38.960
Mission completed.

18:39.040 --> 18:40.480
LUCKY DRAW

18:50.080 --> 18:51.320
I also want to draw.

18:55.040 --> 18:56.360
SPECIAL PRIZE

18:57.000 --> 18:58.920
I won the special prize.

19:00.000 --> 19:03.160
A deluxe suite for the weekend,
with French dinner

19:03.240 --> 19:05.520
and free champagne and wine.

19:07.120 --> 19:09.120
Are all the draws special prizes?

19:14.080 --> 19:15.560
You saw it?

19:20.520 --> 19:22.160
I'll keep the secret.

19:23.560 --> 19:24.960
Is this a lucky draw?

19:26.400 --> 19:28.000
The event is over.

19:34.560 --> 19:35.880
Which shop is it?

19:35.960 --> 19:37.560
Have you registered?

19:38.600 --> 19:40.160
I can't be this unlucky.

19:43.880 --> 19:46.040
Don't run! Stop! Stop!

20:02.880 --> 20:03.720
Thanks.

20:03.800 --> 20:06.000
The fine doesn't matter,
but I can't be exposed.

20:06.600 --> 20:08.400
- Otherwise, Qingli would scold me.
- No.

20:09.160 --> 20:11.400
It seems whenever you meet me,
you get unlucky.

20:11.480 --> 20:12.840
No way.

20:43.360 --> 20:45.400
That's enough. People might see this.

21:05.080 --> 21:07.960
Sister. Guan Shengyu is definitely
having an affair with Ms. Li.

21:08.040 --> 21:08.920
I have evidence.

21:09.000 --> 21:12.840
Secretly recorded videos violate privacy
and cannot be used as legal evidence.

21:12.920 --> 21:16.280
More importantly, we need to prove
they've been having an affair

21:16.360 --> 21:17.840
and transferring marital assets.

21:17.920 --> 21:20.560
Our strategist Lin Yuan
must take all the credit.

21:20.640 --> 21:23.640
I can't believe her dramatic plots
really worked.

21:29.520 --> 21:33.240
For the first unit, I wanted to make birds
the main characters.

21:33.320 --> 21:34.880
However, information shows

21:34.960 --> 21:37.360
that 90% of birds cheat on their partners.

21:38.120 --> 21:40.480
It turns out infidelity
is not just for humans.

21:41.600 --> 21:44.840
If one wants a happy marriage,
they must choose the right person,

21:44.920 --> 21:46.040
and so do birds.

21:47.320 --> 21:50.080
The black vulture, also called
monk vulture or cinereous vulture,

21:50.160 --> 21:51.800
has a very strict clan system.

21:52.480 --> 21:54.680
The male eagle
must stay loyal to his partner.

21:54.760 --> 21:58.440
If he cheats, the whole clan
will despise him.

22:00.120 --> 22:03.360
I didn't know the majestic cinereous
vultures are also afraid of their wives.

22:03.440 --> 22:04.520
Exactly.

22:15.280 --> 22:16.320
Come on.

22:18.840 --> 22:19.920
Over there.

22:21.120 --> 22:22.520
Splendid fairywren.

22:22.600 --> 22:25.040
They're the most romantic birds
in the world.

22:25.120 --> 22:26.880
They'll grow old
and die with their partner.

22:26.960 --> 22:29.920
The male bird will send flowers
to the female bird.

22:30.520 --> 22:32.480
He will sing and dance to make her happy.

22:45.880 --> 22:48.040
The most wonderful thing is,

22:48.840 --> 22:50.560
splendid fairywren's eyes

22:51.360 --> 22:54.240
can see a hundred times
more colors than humans do.

22:55.240 --> 22:56.200
I'm often thinking

22:56.280 --> 22:59.760
that the world they see
are much more colorful than ours.

23:00.400 --> 23:02.160
And when they see each other,

23:02.240 --> 23:04.840
they look more beautiful than us.

23:10.280 --> 23:13.200
They're like the birds
living in fairy tales.

23:14.560 --> 23:17.760
It's the same world,
but they can see it differently.

23:19.760 --> 23:22.520
I used to think this was
just another useless slogan.

23:22.600 --> 23:24.760
It turns out to be true.

23:41.520 --> 23:42.520
So childish.

23:46.480 --> 23:47.360
Su Chengcheng?

23:57.480 --> 23:59.760
You really know many animals.

23:59.840 --> 24:02.560
I hope it can be a little helpful
for your creation.

24:02.640 --> 24:05.360
Not just a little, it's very helpful.

24:06.000 --> 24:08.280
My heroine is so lucky to have met you.

24:08.360 --> 24:10.440
I will definitely pay you back
on behalf of her.

24:14.840 --> 24:16.720
I just received the reward.

24:18.400 --> 24:21.320
I'm really lucky whenever I'm with you.

24:22.200 --> 24:24.000
God bless me!

24:31.960 --> 24:33.600
Bless me!

24:38.320 --> 24:39.320
Gu Yu, look!

24:49.840 --> 24:51.000
We'll share the luck.

24:53.520 --> 24:55.280
That's my bro!

24:59.040 --> 25:00.680
Shall we have dinner together?

25:01.280 --> 25:02.640
I have arrangements.

25:04.960 --> 25:07.360
- With your besties?
- Is there anything you don't know?

25:07.920 --> 25:09.640
Chengcheng and Qingli
asked me to have dinner with them.

25:11.560 --> 25:12.800
Got it.

25:12.880 --> 25:14.760
GETTING RICH
BOOST PRODUCTION, ENSURE QUALITY

25:21.880 --> 25:23.360
I'll treat you today.

25:23.440 --> 25:25.760
You can order whatever you want.

25:25.840 --> 25:27.640
Thank you, sister!

25:27.720 --> 25:30.160
You're the best!

25:30.240 --> 25:31.280
Just eat.

25:36.120 --> 25:37.080
Hello?

25:46.000 --> 25:48.000
Stop. Let's go.

25:48.080 --> 25:49.160
What happened?

25:49.240 --> 25:51.680
Fang Jin woke up, but the hospital
informed Guan Shengyu first.

26:07.080 --> 26:08.560
Get down. Get down!

26:09.560 --> 26:11.000
You're so good at acting.

26:11.080 --> 26:12.440
Why don't you become an actress?

26:12.520 --> 26:15.200
You're not sick at all.
Stop pretending! Get down!

26:16.080 --> 26:18.480
The doctor said I slept for a week.

26:18.560 --> 26:20.160
I don't know what you're talking about.

26:20.840 --> 26:21.720
You don't know?

26:21.800 --> 26:24.360
You colluded with Su Qingli
to set me up again and again.

26:24.440 --> 26:25.560
Now you're faking illness.

26:25.640 --> 26:26.600
What the hell do you want?

26:26.680 --> 26:29.320
I… I don't know what you're talking about.

26:31.080 --> 26:32.360
Weren't you so bold and capable?

26:32.440 --> 26:35.160
You even dared to hit me and threaten me.

26:35.240 --> 26:37.200
Now you're playing innocent, aren't you?

26:37.280 --> 26:38.800
We've been married for years,

26:38.880 --> 26:40.400
but I've just realized
how vicious you are!

26:40.480 --> 26:41.520
I don't want to waste time.

26:41.600 --> 26:42.960
Get up and leave with me.

26:44.320 --> 26:45.680
Didn't you hear me?

26:47.160 --> 26:48.240
Get up.

27:04.120 --> 27:05.800
Hello. Where's Fang Jin?

27:05.880 --> 27:07.680
The patient in this ward?

27:07.760 --> 27:09.680
- Yes.
- Her husband took her out.

27:13.560 --> 27:15.640
Fang Jin just woke up
and doesn't know anything.

27:15.720 --> 27:17.720
Will Guan Shengyu discover our secret?

27:32.640 --> 27:33.720
It's Tang Qi.

27:34.360 --> 27:35.680
Don't answer it.

27:35.760 --> 27:37.840
We must find Fang Jin first.

27:38.400 --> 27:39.240
Let's go.

27:48.280 --> 27:50.360
I saw you with Guan Shengyu,

27:50.440 --> 27:51.720
so I didn't approach you.

27:52.320 --> 27:55.080
Is this your plan again?

28:33.120 --> 28:34.200
Guan Shengyu came.

28:34.280 --> 28:35.680
We're late.

28:36.360 --> 28:38.400
Was Guan Shengyu looking for something?

28:44.560 --> 28:46.760
He was looking for
the upgrading materials of elastic mesh.

28:47.360 --> 28:50.480
Yes. To prevent Guan Shengyu
from selling the patent to Vandai,

28:50.560 --> 28:53.160
I posed as Fang Jin
and told Ms. Xiang it had a flaw

28:53.240 --> 28:54.720
and was upgrading.

28:54.800 --> 28:56.280
I'm sure he wants to get the new materials

28:56.360 --> 28:57.480
and sell the patent.

28:57.560 --> 28:59.840
Chengcheng made that up.

29:00.480 --> 29:01.920
There's no such material.

29:03.440 --> 29:05.000
Guan Shengyu won't believe it.

29:05.080 --> 29:06.920
He'll torture Fang Jin
and force her to tell him.

29:12.360 --> 29:13.680
It's Tang Qi.

29:19.040 --> 29:20.760
He saw Guan Shengyu and Fang Jin.

29:27.280 --> 29:28.160
Where's Fang Jin?

29:34.120 --> 29:35.080
Go!

29:37.040 --> 29:38.360
Get off me!

29:39.720 --> 29:41.160
Get off me!

29:46.040 --> 29:47.040
What do you want?

29:47.120 --> 29:50.240
I really don't have
the upgrading materials you mentioned!

29:50.320 --> 29:52.040
Do you think I will believe you?

29:52.120 --> 29:53.960
Su Qingli and you
wouldn't tell the truth because

29:54.040 --> 29:56.800
you want to apply for a new patent
with the upgrading plan after the divorce!

29:56.880 --> 29:58.880
There's no upgrading plan!

29:59.600 --> 30:01.360
Who told you that?

30:01.440 --> 30:03.800
You told Ms. Xiang in person.
How dare you deny it?

30:04.560 --> 30:06.320
It must be a misunderstanding.

30:06.400 --> 30:07.840
I was in a coma.

30:07.920 --> 30:09.960
I have no idea who Ms. Xiang is.

30:10.040 --> 30:10.880
You don't know?

30:15.040 --> 30:16.640
- You don't know?
- Stop!

30:35.520 --> 30:36.480
Get off her!

30:37.280 --> 30:38.720
Come on. Look.

30:38.800 --> 30:39.960
Look who's here.

30:42.600 --> 30:44.240
How dare you say
you're not having an affair?

31:10.320 --> 31:11.920
SAFETY FIRST

31:59.880 --> 32:01.680
In the middle of the night,

32:02.200 --> 32:04.160
at a well-guarded factory

32:04.240 --> 32:06.560
in the distant area,

32:06.640 --> 32:09.160
a group of strong men

32:09.240 --> 32:11.080
and a weak girl…

32:13.360 --> 32:15.240
At this point, we must…

32:15.320 --> 32:16.600
Call the police.

32:17.560 --> 32:19.600
Yes, call the police.

32:28.080 --> 32:29.080
No service.

32:31.160 --> 32:32.040
Listen,

32:32.120 --> 32:33.800
go to a place with service
to call the police,

32:33.880 --> 32:35.320
and I'll go inside.

32:35.400 --> 32:37.600
- Be careful.
- Bye.

33:27.920 --> 33:29.000
ASSISTIVE DEVICES, GARBAGE BAG
INSTRUCTION MANUAL

34:18.520 --> 34:20.360
It seems the tree is walking.

34:21.880 --> 34:24.239
Then it'd be a tree monster.

34:24.320 --> 34:25.920
Do you think this is Strange Tales?

34:26.000 --> 34:28.000
We're not that scholar.

34:29.199 --> 34:30.400
Am I wrong?

34:32.639 --> 34:35.040
That tree is coming over!

34:37.639 --> 34:38.760
Where's the tree?

34:39.920 --> 34:41.520
It's just a box.

34:44.320 --> 34:46.040
PLEASE DO NOT PLACE UPSIDE DOWN

34:48.360 --> 34:49.840
I must be too sleepy.

34:49.920 --> 34:52.560
I'll take a nap. Keep an eye on it.

34:52.639 --> 34:53.760
Fine.

35:58.160 --> 36:00.120
That weak man is about to wake up.

36:00.680 --> 36:01.680
Let's check on him.

36:01.760 --> 36:03.320
If he wakes up, we'll hit him again.

36:05.280 --> 36:06.320
What's the sound?

36:07.520 --> 36:08.560
Let's go.

36:29.320 --> 36:30.440
SCAMMING

36:30.520 --> 36:31.600
RECOGNITION FAILED

36:37.920 --> 36:40.280
SCAMMING

36:49.560 --> 36:50.840
Did Guan Shengyu hurt you?

36:51.360 --> 36:52.440
Are you here to save me?

36:54.320 --> 36:55.800
Why are you here alone?

37:00.880 --> 37:01.960
Who else should be here?

37:04.560 --> 37:05.400
Guan Shengyu.

37:06.280 --> 37:08.520
Do you know where Guan Shengyu took me?

37:09.520 --> 37:11.520
I don't know. I passed out.

37:14.760 --> 37:15.840
You don't know?

37:17.920 --> 37:19.080
I also passed out.

37:26.840 --> 37:27.840
Get out of here first.

37:27.920 --> 37:29.760
I have something
to discuss with Guan Shengyu.

37:29.840 --> 37:30.880
I need to see him.

37:31.760 --> 37:32.960
I'll go with you.

37:34.360 --> 37:36.680
I must get rid of Tang Qi.

37:57.240 --> 37:59.080
I'll lure them.

37:59.160 --> 38:00.480
Find a chance to get out.

38:02.200 --> 38:04.080
Hide here. Don't come out.

38:09.920 --> 38:11.760
- Ms. Fang?
- Ms. Fang.

38:11.840 --> 38:13.160
Where's Guan Shengyu?

38:13.240 --> 38:15.560
He's either in the info room
on the 7th floor

38:15.640 --> 38:17.400
or on the 5th floor.

38:28.320 --> 38:30.120
Run! Don't worry about me!

38:34.680 --> 38:37.240
Run! Don't worry about me!

39:29.880 --> 39:31.520
Did I screw it up again?

39:35.840 --> 39:37.160
Check over there.

39:43.800 --> 39:44.640
Let's split up.

39:44.720 --> 39:46.080
Our boss said he'd reward us.

39:46.160 --> 39:47.800
Okay, I'll go over there.

39:57.520 --> 39:58.360
Sorry.

39:59.000 --> 40:01.280
Your acting was so real
when you were with him

40:01.360 --> 40:03.120
that I thought you were weak.

40:04.120 --> 40:05.160
Did you record it?

40:06.920 --> 40:08.160
No.

40:08.240 --> 40:09.560
Isn't… Isn't this your plan?

40:09.640 --> 40:11.160
Didn't you keep any evidence?

41:35.560 --> 41:36.800
I need to see Guan Shengyu.

41:36.880 --> 41:37.880
Don't follow me.

41:37.960 --> 41:39.040
I don't need your help.

41:48.440 --> 41:52.840
Maybe your feelings for Fang Jin
is just an illusion.

41:52.920 --> 41:55.520
Once you meet her a few more times,
you might find out

41:55.600 --> 41:58.320
you've mistaken compassion for love.

42:02.600 --> 42:03.640
Gu Yu was wrong.

42:04.800 --> 42:08.240
My feelings for her are real.

42:10.880 --> 42:11.960
Tang Qi…

42:15.880 --> 42:17.600
You're really a scum!

42:40.080 --> 42:41.360
Get up.

42:41.440 --> 42:42.280
Tell me.

42:43.080 --> 42:45.440
Where are the upgrading materials
of the elastic mesh?

42:45.520 --> 42:46.520
Where are they?

42:47.240 --> 42:50.520
I don't know.
I don't know what you're talking about!

42:52.480 --> 42:54.560
Okay, okay.

42:54.640 --> 42:57.160
Don't be afraid. Listen to me.

42:57.240 --> 42:58.240
I won't hit you.

42:58.320 --> 42:59.840
I shouldn't have hit you. I'm sorry.

42:59.920 --> 43:01.280
Could you tell me where they are?

43:01.360 --> 43:02.440
I'm begging you.

43:03.240 --> 43:05.400
I really don't know!

43:32.320 --> 43:33.320
Fang Jin.

43:35.040 --> 43:36.200
Where are you?

43:43.360 --> 43:44.280
Come out!

43:47.360 --> 43:48.440
Fang Jin!

43:51.080 --> 43:52.360
I'm warning you.

43:53.320 --> 43:55.160
If I find you, I won't go easy on you!

44:00.320 --> 44:01.360
Don't be afraid.

44:01.440 --> 44:03.040
I'm Su Chengcheng, Su Qingli's sister.

44:03.120 --> 44:04.560
I'm here to save you.

44:07.440 --> 44:08.720
I'll get you out of here.

44:10.200 --> 44:11.760
Fang Jin, I'm warning you.

44:11.840 --> 44:13.280
Show yourself.

44:24.560 --> 44:25.880
Is this the only exit?

44:26.960 --> 44:28.240
And the elevator.

44:29.280 --> 44:32.240
There are cameras and guards.
I'll lure the guards.

44:36.080 --> 44:37.080
It's okay.

44:37.160 --> 44:38.440
Guan Shengyu only wants you.

44:38.520 --> 44:39.400
He won't hurt me.

44:40.040 --> 44:41.520
Don't worry about anything. Keep running.

44:41.600 --> 44:43.240
My sister is waiting outside.

44:43.320 --> 44:44.360
Bye.

45:02.600 --> 45:03.600
Catch her!

45:05.800 --> 45:06.960
Stop!

45:21.040 --> 45:22.280
Thank God, you're here.

45:22.360 --> 45:25.520
The guard is chasing me.
Help me knock him out!

45:25.600 --> 45:26.920
Knock him out!

45:28.960 --> 45:31.040
I… I can't!

45:45.320 --> 45:47.240
Fang Jin! Fang Jin! Don't leave me alone!

45:47.320 --> 45:49.080
I… I don't know you!

46:16.880 --> 46:18.360
I don't know you!

46:19.000 --> 46:21.480
She found out how I feel about her.

46:21.560 --> 46:22.880
She thinks I'm disgusting.

46:23.600 --> 46:25.560
She wishes she'd never met me.

46:56.120 --> 46:57.440
Are you injured?

46:58.840 --> 47:00.840
If you can't walk, I'll carry you.

47:06.480 --> 47:07.440
I'm fine.

47:10.320 --> 47:11.520
You…

47:13.400 --> 47:15.040
Didn't you say you don't know me?

47:16.920 --> 47:18.720
Why did you come back?

47:24.320 --> 47:26.000
Did you meet me?

47:27.400 --> 47:28.680
I was in a bad mood.

47:28.760 --> 47:30.160
Don't take it seriously.

47:33.400 --> 47:36.160
Did you find out I…?

47:40.840 --> 47:42.000
Bad mood?

47:42.080 --> 47:43.320
Found out what?

47:48.120 --> 47:49.000
Nothing.

47:51.000 --> 47:51.920
Let's go.

48:08.960 --> 48:11.200
What did I tell you? Didn't you hear me?

48:15.160 --> 48:16.200
Fang Jin!

48:18.040 --> 48:18.880
Come on. Run.

48:18.960 --> 48:19.960
Keep running.

48:20.040 --> 48:21.920
- Fang Jin!
- Where are you going?

48:33.960 --> 48:35.480
It's stuck again.

48:35.560 --> 48:36.720
Why am I so unlucky?

48:37.600 --> 48:39.200
- Fang Jin. Fang Jin!
- You're disobedient.

48:39.280 --> 48:40.520
Get off me!

48:43.360 --> 48:44.800
Fang Jin!

49:00.240 --> 49:02.240
I've told you that you can't escape.

49:02.880 --> 49:04.480
Give me the upgrading materials,

49:04.560 --> 49:07.080
and I'll free you and your lover.
Why are you so disobedient?

49:07.160 --> 49:08.680
Get off me!

49:10.200 --> 49:12.680
I don't know what you're talking about!

49:12.760 --> 49:14.600
Is this also her plan?

49:15.120 --> 49:16.120
You don't know?

49:16.200 --> 49:17.520
Fine, I'll let you know.

49:17.600 --> 49:19.000
I'll let you know.

49:20.160 --> 49:22.040
I just… Come on. Run.

49:22.120 --> 49:23.200
Run, run.

49:26.120 --> 49:27.840
Perfect timing.

49:37.120 --> 49:38.400
- Behave.
- Fang Jin.

49:38.480 --> 49:39.360
- Qingli! Qingli!
- Fang Jin!

49:39.440 --> 49:40.680
- Behave.
- Go away!

49:40.760 --> 49:42.160
Don't move!

49:42.240 --> 49:44.000
Hello. We got a report.

49:44.080 --> 49:45.320
We're here to investigate it.

49:45.400 --> 49:46.280
Nothing happened.

49:46.360 --> 49:48.160
- This is my…
- Please come with us

49:48.240 --> 49:49.560
and cooperate with the investigation.

49:49.640 --> 49:51.240
Why? What was the report?

49:51.960 --> 49:54.840
We got a report
that you harmed other people.

49:54.920 --> 49:56.160
Please be cooperative.

49:56.240 --> 49:57.880
Fine. Okay.

49:57.960 --> 49:59.440
No problem. I'll be cooperative.
